# PlanTo3D image (services/planto3d/Dockerfile): never ship jobs, local assets, built library files or client drawings
services/planto3d/jobs
services/planto3d/assets
services/planto3d/node_modules
services/planto3d/library/*
!services/planto3d/library/build
services/planto3d/library/build/out
docs/reference
docs/overnight
docs/run3
**/.venv
**/node_modules
